1. BANC v888 connectome
   Bates, Phelps, Kim, Yang et al., Nature 2026.
   Paper: https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-026-10735-w
   Data:  https://doi.org/10.7910/DVN/7WTH1N  (CC BY 4.0)
   Compiled feathers: GCS bucket lee-lab_brain-and-nerve-cord-fly-connectome
   This repo ships a derived, compressed circuit cut (~2.8k neurons). Cite BANC
   if you use the pack or rebuild it.

2. LIF constants
   Shiu et al., Nature 2024 (FAFB Drosophila brain model defaults).
   Inspected precedent: https://github.com/philshiu/Drosophila_brain_model
   Applying those constants to a BANC edgelist is not a validated BANC
   physiological model.

3. Parliamentary votes
   Openpolis Open Parlamento API (attribution required).
   Camera / Senato open data (CC BY).
   Counts are copied, never invented. Pontida is not a parliamentary vote.

